{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42509","headline":"寄禅月大师 · 张格","name":"寄禅月大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙华咫尺断来音，日夕空驰咏德心。\n禅月字清师号别，寿春诗古帝恩深。\n画成罗汉惊三界，书似张颠直万金。\n莫倚名高忘故旧，晓晴闲步一相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张格","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}